<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">Built for Jewelry & Watches</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Built for serialized, high-value retail.</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Jewelry retailers need more than a checkout tool. You need serialized tracking, enterprise security, global compliance, and the omnichannel infrastructure to operate across stores, online, and consignment.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillars-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);">
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <div class="pillar-icon"><i class="ti ti-scan"></i></div>
        <h3 class="pillar-title">RFID serialized tracking</h3>
        <p class="pillar-desc">Every piece gets a unique EPC — its own digital passport. Track individual items through receiving, display case, consignment, sale, and beyond. <a href="/platform/rfid/" style="color: var(--brand-text);">Wave a handheld over a display case and count 50 items in seconds</a>. No more 2-hour open/close counts.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <div class="pillar-icon"><i class="ti ti-shield-lock"></i></div>
        <h3 class="pillar-title">Enterprise-grade security</h3>
        <p class="pillar-desc">SOC 2 Type 2 certified, GDPR and PCI DSS compliant, with role-based access control that governs exactly who can see what. Full audit trails log every item viewed, case opened, and transaction processed.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <div class="pillar-icon"><i class="ti ti-user-heart"></i></div>
        <h3 class="pillar-title">Clienteling & CRM</h3>
        <p class="pillar-desc">Replace paper client books with a secure, unified CRM that tracks ring sizes, metal preferences, anniversary dates, purchase history, and wishlists across every channel. <a href="/platform/cxp/" style="color: var(--brand-text);">121 Commerce AI</a> surfaces recommendations before the associate even asks.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <div class="pillar-icon"><i class="ti ti-device-mobile"></i></div>
        <h3 class="pillar-title">Mobile showroom experience</h3>
        <p class="pillar-desc">Associates serve customers anywhere in the showroom with <a href="/platform/mobile-pos/" style="color: var(--brand-text);">an iOS device</a>. Answer product questions, process deposits for custom orders or consignments, and capture customer details for follow-up — without walking to a register.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <div class="pillar-icon"><i class="ti ti-gift"></i></div>
        <h3 class="pillar-title">Gift cards, loyalty & VIP</h3>
        <p class="pillar-desc">Digital and physical gift cards, omnichannel loyalty programs, and VIP tiers come built in. Customize them for high-value customers with anniversary reminders, targeted offers, and exclusive access to new collections.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <div class="pillar-icon"><i class="ti ti-world"></i></div>
        <h3 class="pillar-title">Global operations</h3>
        <p class="pillar-desc">The platform is localized and live in 40+ countries, with multi-currency, multi-language support and automated fiscal compliance built in (VAT, GST, NF525, TSE). Expand from one boutique to a global chain without changing platforms or adding regional vendors.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

